            {
              "id": "1775571241654_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the Partner information you have about the current partner {{$context.$nodes.GETPARTNERDATA.$output}} generate a partner summary in following format:\nPartner Summary:\nProfile Completion: xx.x%\nDetails Available:\nMissing Details:\nRecommended next best actions:\n\n##requirement \nOnly look for following information for partner profile completeness check - OrganizationName, FormattedAddress, PhoneNumber, EmailAddress, PrimaryContactPartyName, LineOfBusiness, EmployeesTotal, YearEstablished, ComplianceStatus, PartnerSummary, SolutionOverview and AnnualRevenue. If these details are available, mark partner profile as 100% complete and ready for approval. Show presentable display name of these fields in output like Organization Name, Formatted Address, Phone Number, Email Address, Primary Contact, Line Of Business, Total No of Employees, Year Established, Compliance Status, Partner Summary, Solution Overview and Annual Revenue.\n\n##requirement \nNever show unique identifiers like PartyId, PartyNumber, PreferredContactPersonId, PrimaryContactPartyNumber, EnrollmentID, PartnerID, ProgramID or any similar unique identifiers in response.\n\n##requirement \nUse less than 8000 characters for your recommendations\n\n##requirement \nDO NOT provide any \"If you want, I can:\" content"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
