          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775735888730_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the Partner information you have about the current partner {{$context.$nodes.REFRESHPARTNERDATA.$output}} and program enrollment data from {{$context.$nodes.REFRESHENROLLMENTDATA.$output}} generate an onboarding status summary in following format:\nGenerate an onboarding status similar to this {{$context.$variables.PartnerName}} is now onboarded and ready for engaged in sales and marketing activities.\nPartner Summary with status, Tier and other details but header should only say \"Partner Summary\": \nProgram Enrollment Summary with listed Benefits with value:\nRecommended next steps:\n\n##requirement \nShow presentable display name of these fields in output like Organization Name, Formatted Address, Phone Number, Email Address, Primary Contact, Line Of Business, Total No of Employees, Year Established, Compliance Status, Partner Summary, Solution Overview and Annual Revenue.\n\n##requirement \nNever show unique identifiers like PartyId, PartyNumber, PreferredContactPersonId, PrimaryContactPartyNumber, EnrollmentID, PartnerID, ProgramID or any similar unique identifiers in response.\n\n##requirement \nUse less than 5000 characters for your recommendations\n\n##requirement \nDO NOT provide any \"If you want, I can:\" content"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
